flowchart LR
    P([Player]) -->|clicks object| IMG[Room picture]
    IMG -->|x, y| HT[hit_test<br/>visible objects only]
    HT --> BTN[Context buttons<br/>Examine, Take, Open,<br/>Use held item, keypad]
    BTN -->|structured Action| EN
    P -->|or types an action| PR[Action parser<br/>rules first]
    PR -.->|only if not understood| LP[(Gemini<br/>JSON intent parser)]
    PR -->|Action| EN[Game engine<br/>game_engine.py<br/>validates + updates state]
    CFG[[game_config.json<br/>objects, hints,<br/>solution]] --> EN
    EN <--> ST[(Game state dict<br/>inventory, flags,<br/>solved puzzles, door)]
    EN -->|Result + public state<br/>NO solutions| NA[Narrator]
    NA -->|describe this outcome| LLM[(Gemini)]
    LLM -->|narration| GD{Output guard}
    GD -->|consistent| SP[Story panel]
    GD -->|contradicts engine<br/>or leaks code| FB[Engine facts<br/>fallback text] --> SP
    ST -->|redraw every turn| RR[room_renderer.render] --> IMG
    ST --> SB[Sidebar: inventory,<br/>puzzles, door, JSON state]
    classDef trusted fill:#e3f4e8,stroke:#27ae60,color:#000;
    class EN,ST,CFG,GD,HT trusted
